cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this list helps your research, please cite it as below, and cite the survey listed under preferred-citation."
type: dataset
title: "Awesome Looped Models for Medical Imaging: A Curated List of Iterative Architectures, Test-Time Adaptation and Feedback Loops"
abstract: >-
  The companion list to the survey "Looped Models for Medical Imaging: A Survey
  of Iterative Architectures, Test-Time Adaptation, and Feedback". Papers and
  code in which a medical imaging model, its training data or the deployed
  system is updated by repeated computation: recurrent, recursive and
  equilibrium networks; unrolled and data-consistency reconstruction; test-time
  adaptation and training; self-training, co-training and active learning; and
  human-in-the-loop, post-deployment and continual-learning loops.
authors:
  - name: "Big-Matrix R&D Lab, North South University"
