  - recurrent networks
  - deep equilibrium models
  - algorithm unrolling
  - data consistency
  - MRI reconstruction
  - test-time adaptation
  - test-time training
  - self-training
  - active learning
  - human-in-the-loop
  - continual learning
  - medical imaging
  - awesome list
